  "title": "Sugar-Free Cake",
  "description": "This sugar-free cake, flavored with cinnamon and nutmeg, is made with applesauce, eggs, nuts, raisins, and liquid sweetener for a tender Bundt cake.",
  "authors": [
    "L. Kahrl"
  ],
  "date_published": "1998-05-06T23:08:27-04:00",
